{"synopsis":"Seorang pengantar barang secara tak terduga menemukan dirinya dengan seorang pacar yang cantik setelah pertemuan yang tidak disengaja, hanya untuk menyadari bahwa keberuntungan romantisnya baru saja dimulai! Wanita-wanita cantik dari segala penjuru tertarik padanya, berlomba-lomba untuk mendapatkan kasih sayangnya. Sebagai seorang perjaka, dia kewalahan dengan perhatian itu-tidak ada habisnya untuk berpelukan! Dan tunggu… apakah itu semangat batinnya yang bangkit kembali? Terjunlah ke dalam angin puyuh romansa supernatural, komedi, dan kegembiraan","alternative_title":"我在异族开后宫, My Wife Comes From the Thousand","author":"洛咔动漫","artist":"洛咔动漫","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"40ddadef-1182-4f29-b62b-84166491fb2a","number":"150","chapter":"150","title":"Chapter 150","date":"2026-08-02","released":"2026-08-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ae6240b1-7bbd-4b55-a4d1-c23652bb58c0","number":"149","chapter":"149","title":"Chapter 149","date":"2026-08-02","released":"2026-08-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"1adb923f-ba23-4249-a7c3-c092ddfa71eb","number":"148","chapter":"148","title":"Chapter 148","date":"2026-06-06","released":"2026-06-06","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"e86044c3-f8df-4dce-9e00-f54c41bbea61","number":"147","chapter":"147","title":"Chapter 147","date":"2026-06-05","released":"2026-06-05","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"dc7691b8-4199-4fe5-a532-4aaa3d7fdf1a","number":"146","chapter":"146","title":"Chapter 146","date":"2026-06-04","released":"2026-06-04","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"1ce66315-1d03-4f09-a01f-d63628546b04","number":"145","chapter":"145","title":"Chapter 145","date":"2026-06-03","released":"2026-06-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"fffa889e-de88-4c40-bd86-4180252edff3","number":"144","chapter":"144","title":"Chapter 144","date":"2026-06-02","released":"2026-06-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"eb1bf4e0-3ac6-406f-a58a-d09c0f8febbc","number":"143","chapter":"143","title":"Chapter 143","date":"2026-06-01","released":"2026-06-01","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"c2ca3c